      "comment": "Violetta: Spirit Seeker",
      "content": "\"Spirit Seeker\" is a classic ballet passed down the Spessiva family. Marionette says it has not been performed in years and that Odette has been rehearsing it for a return to the stage. In the quest Mistilteinn, a memory of Signora speaking to Odette says she had seen it performed many times, including by Odette's mother.",
